# ── Metered.ca TURN Server Credentials (Server-Only) ────────────────
# TURN relay credentials for cross-device WebRTC P2P sync.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# Kept server-side only (never use NEXT_PUBLIC_*) and proxied via /api/ice-servers.
# Both are required for TURN relay; without them the app falls back to STUN-only.
#
# Security note:
# Because Notebook has no user accounts or authentication, /api/ice-servers remains
# publicly reachable. Hiding the API key on the server prevents direct key theft from
# client bundles, but does not by itself prevent third parties from abusing TURN relay
# credentials via /api/ice-servers. Configure provider-side safeguards in Metered:
#   - Allowed domains / Referer restrictions (where supported)
#   - Short TURN credential expiry / TTL
#   - Rate limits, bandwidth quotas, and hard billing/usage caps
METERED_APP_NAME=
METERED_API_KEY=
